{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/torah/uvenuchoh","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n196.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"description","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en"}}
{"text":"When the scroll of the Torah is returned to the Holy Ark:"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"10","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/uvenuchoh/numbers_10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/uvenuchoh/numbers_10/36","n":"36"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/10/36"}}
{"text":"When it rested He said: ‘Return, O Lord, to the myriads of thousands of Israel’."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"132","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/uvenuchoh/psalms_132"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/uvenuchoh/psalms_132/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/132/8"}}
{"text":"Arise, O Lord, to Thy resting-place, Thou and the Ark of Thy strength."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/uvenuchoh/psalms_132/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/132/9"}}
{"text":"Thy priests are clothed in righteousness and Thy pious ones exult."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/uvenuchoh/psalms_132/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/132/10"}}
{"text":"For the sake of David, Thy servant, do not turn back the face of Thine anointed."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"4","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/uvenuchoh/proverbs_4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/uvenuchoh/proverbs_4/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:proverbs/4/2"}}
{"text":"For a fine portion have I given you, do not forsake my Torah."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"3","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/uvenuchoh/proverbs_3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/uvenuchoh/proverbs_3/18","n":"18"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:proverbs/3/18"}}
{"text":"It is a tree of life for those who grasp it and whoever supports it is made happy."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/uvenuchoh/proverbs_3/17","n":"17"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:proverbs/3/17"}}
{"text":"Its ways are delightful ways and all its paths are peace."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"5","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/uvenuchoh/lamentations_5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/torah/return/uvenuchoh/lamentations_5/21","n":"21"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:lamentations/5/21"}}
{"text":"Restore us, O Lord, to Thee, that we may return, renew our days as of old."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
